PREAMBLE

This work is offered in the spirit of Sacred Commons - a gift economy approach
to intellectual property that honors both the source and the flow. Like water
that nourishes all it touches while remaining water, this work is shared
freely while maintaining its sacred intention.

We believe:
- Knowledge multiplies when shared
- Attribution honors the flow of gifts
- Modification enables adaptation to local needs
- Commercial use can coexist with sacred intention
- The gift must always move

This license balances freedom with responsibility, openness with integrity,
and individual rights with collective benefit.

