- Creating derivative works that benefit others

Reciprocity maintains the flow that allows open sharing to continue.

================================================================================

COMPARISON TO STANDARD LICENSES

This Sacred Commons License is philosophically similar to:
- MIT License (permissive, attribution required)
- Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike (CC BY-SA)
- GPL (copyleft for software freedom)

But adds:
- Sacred intention and values alignment
- Explicit accessibility requirements
- Ethical use guidelines
- Voluntary reciprocity encouragement

For maximum compatibility, derivative works may be relicensed under MIT,
Apache 2.0, or GPL while maintaining attribution.

